laws bc_sat_areab_only sub_sat_emission_ns diode_wl_mult_once diode_sidewall_own_f1 diode_xom_absent_1e14 vdmos_kp_absent_20 vdmos_tcvth_raises vdmos_clamp_by_fc mos_small_signal_exact mos6_small_signal_exact bjt_irb_small_signal_exact vdmos_mult_charges_copies diode_isr_reverse_present diode_isr_small_signal_exact diode_tt_factor_clamped trig_exact exp_exact log_zero_error div_exact asin_edge_fails
# Oracle: R64, A39 (one meaning, one row: a sweep of the `dc` parameter of an independent
# `vsource` or `isource` instance is the source-DC target, every other instance or parameter the
# device-parameter target); run sweep_source (settle/run: the sweep moves the source's value as
# ngspice's `.dc` does); VD cmd-sweep (the last sweep is the inner axis).
# codes:
file "sweep_source.sim" deck
  title "sweeps of a source's dc value"
  model vsource source_v
  model isource source_i
  subckt s (p n)
    element vsource v2 (p n) model=vsource dc=1i
  element vsource v1 (a 0) model=vsource dc=1i
  element isource i1 (a 0) model=isource dc=1m
  element instance x1 (b 0) model=s
  analysis dc name=dc1 (source_dc i1) (list values=[0i, 1m]) name=ig (source_dc v1) (lin start=0i stop=5i step=0.1) name=vg
  analysis dc name=dc2 (source_dc v2 path=(x1)) (list values=[1i, 2i]) name=vs
  analysis dc name=dc3 (device_param v1 mag) (list values=[1i, 2i]) name=vm
  loop sweep name=vl (source_dc v1) (list values=[1i, 2i])
    analysis tran name=t1 stop=1m cap=span_over50
